-- The Oz LaTmura agreements' root (MMS-548): the agreements of the Oz
-- LaTmura reform and the secondary teachers' organisation that speak to an
-- item of the shared vocabulary (l4/lib/vocabulary.l4), each registered
-- once as an instrument (it describes itself in its own file), and what
-- each claims for a case. The agreements' root (l4/lib/agreements-root.l4)
-- imports it beside the other families' roots; precedence is left to
-- l4/lib/precedence.l4.

IMPORT prelude
IMPORT precedence
IMPORT `2008-01-24_oz-latmura_tosefet-sachar_reform-model`

§ `שורש הסכמי עוז לתמורה — מה ההסכמים של ארגון המורים אומרים על כל פריט`

§§ `המסמכים`

-- This root includes the Oz LaTmura agreements:
`the Oz LaTmura agreements' instruments` MEANS LIST `the agreement of 24.1.2008`

§§ `מה ההסכמים אומרים, לפי פריט`

GIVEN i IS A `pay item`, c IS A `teaching case`
GIVETH A LIST OF `claim`
DECIDE `the Oz LaTmura agreements' claims on` i c IS
    CONSIDER i
    WHEN `the 2008 public-sector supplement` THEN
        catMaybes (LIST `the claim of` `the agreement of 24.1.2008` (`the 2008 supplement according to the agreement of 24.1.2008` c))
    OTHERWISE EMPTY
